sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Manager
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant FCM as Firebase FCM

    M->>App: Buka daftar booking status open
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/bookings?status=open
    API->>DB: SELECT bookings WHERE status = open
    DB-->>API: List booking
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>M: Tampilkan daftar booking

    M->>App: Pilih booking lalu tap Assign Teknisi
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/users?role=teknisi
    API->>DB: SELECT users WHERE role = teknisi
    DB-->>API: List teknisi
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>M: Tampilkan pilihan teknisi

    M->>App: Pilih teknisi lalu konfirmasi
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/assign
    API->>DB: UPDATE technician_id dan status = in_progress
    DB-->>API: OK

    API->>FCM: Notifikasi ke Teknisi ditugaskan
    FCM-->>API: OK
    API->>FCM: Notifikasi ke Client teknisi disiapkan
    FCM-->>API: OK

    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>M: Konfirmasi assign berhasil
